### VENUE_AMENITIES
Normalizes what was a newline-separated text blob in the prototype into rows.

| Field | Type |
|---|---|
| venue_id | FK → VENUES |
| amenity | string |

### VENUE_MEDIA
Gallery images/video, upload-managed.

| Field | Type |
|---|---|
| media_id | PK |
| venue_id | FK → VENUES |
| url | string |
| media_type | enum: `image`, `video` |
