### AVAILABILITY_BLOCKS
One row per blocked date (the prototype stored these as a JSON array on the venue —
normalize to rows so the calendar can be queried directly).

| Field | Type |
|---|---|
| block_id | PK |
| venue_id | FK → VENUES |
| blocked_date | date |

### LEADS (inquiries)
Covers both single-venue inquiries and RFP (request-for-proposal) batch sends —
an RFP just creates one LEADS row per selected venue.

| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| lead_id | PK | |
| venue_id | FK → VENUES | |
| client_id | FK → USERS, nullable | guests can submit inquiries without an account |
| is_rfp | boolean | |
| name, email, company | string | company only set on RFP/B2B |
| event_type | string | |
| event_date | date | |
| guest_count | int | |
| budget | string, nullable | RFP only |
| message | text | |
| status | enum: `new`, `accepted`, `declined`, `archived`, `deposit_paid` | |
| host_reply | text, nullable | |
| reply_hours | decimal, nullable | response-time tracking for owner analytics |
| created_at | timestamp | |

### REVIEWS
Requires admin moderation before publishing.

| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| review_id | PK | |
| venue_id | FK → VENUES | |
| lead_id | FK → LEADS, nullable | set when the reviewer's email matches an accepted lead for this venue — drives `verified_booking` |
| author_name, author_email | string | |
| rating | int, 1–5 | |
| review_text | text, min 20 chars | |
| event_type | string | |
| verified_booking | boolean | |
| status | enum: `pending`, `published`, `rejected` | |
| created_at | timestamp | |

### DEPOSITS
20% deposit via Stripe PaymentIntent, tied to an accepted lead.

| Field | Type |
|---|---|
| deposit_id | PK |
| lead_id | FK → LEADS |
| stripe_payment_intent_id | string |
| amount_mad | int |
| percent | int |
| status | enum: `pending`, `paid` |
| paid_at | timestamp, nullable |

### SAVED_VENUES
Many-to-many join for clients bookmarking venues.

| Field | Type |
|---|---|
| user_id | FK → USERS |
| venue_id | FK → VENUES |
| saved_at | timestamp |
| *(composite PK on user_id + venue_id)* | |

